{"5066910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trialborn", "steam_appid": 5066910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trialborn have taken inspiration from FPS classics from late 90's up to 2010's. By combining fast-paced action, environmental puzzles, platforming, more in dept secrets, and deep lore, the experience will feel both unique and satisfying.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play any way you like, it being tactical, or fast-paced. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment, shoot with precision and use movement to overcome the Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, solve environmental puzzles, overcome platforming challenges, and uncover hidden secrets containing valuables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/1cdd51b809a61b9a099b99bf2d4809da.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/1cdd51b809a61b9a099b99bf2d4809da.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/1cdd51b809a61b9a099b99bf2d4809da.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the lore behind Trialborn and uncover the influence of the Trialmaster as you explore a world filled with ancient secrets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trialborn have taken inspiration from FPS classics from late 90's up to 2010's. By combining fast-paced action, environmental puzzles, platforming, more in dept secrets, and deep lore, the experience will feel both unique and satisfying.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4779c8c08bd8efa66ddcca574670b01f.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play any way you like, it being tactical, or fast-paced. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/4094dfaa9db04379d1b66363fe6d1345.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment, shoot with precision and use movement to overcome the Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.poster.avif?t=1787253281\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.webm?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066910/extras/8cae9c3ab46cbc02f8d2064afec7806a.mp4?t=1787253281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"b